{\b Try ArrowKeys}
\par ArrowKeys opens automatically for the signed-in user. When prompted, enable ArrowKeys in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Accessibility. Caps Lock is set up automatically when permission is available. Look for Navigation active in the ArrowKeys menu. Open at Login is on by default. You can turn it off in the ArrowKeys menu. If upgrading from the Karabiner edition, remove its ArrowKeys rule in Complex Modifications.
\par To uninstall, move ArrowKeys.app from Applications to Trash. Quitting ArrowKeys or moving the running app to Trash restores the previous Caps Lock assignment on each keyboard it changed.
}
